<title>BELGIUM: EU to discuss 96/97 cereals balance sheet.</title>
<headline>EU to discuss 96/97 cereals balance sheet.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals experts group will discuss the latest crop area forecasts for 1996/97 on Thursday, an EU offcicial said.</p>
<p>&quot;The group will discuss the latest cereals balance sheet,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>On December 6, Coceral, the EU grain trade lobby, put the crop at 203 million tonnes, up from 175.8 million in 1955/96.</p>
<p>But a European Commission grain official said the same day that the figure was closer to 200 million tonnes.</p>
</text>
